 "statement": {
  "status": "present",
  "value": "StockTracker() starts with no trades. recordTrade(stockName, quantity) adds quantity to the stock's total, creating it when new. getRankedStocks() returns the names of all stocks with at least one trade, ordered by total quantity descending and then by name ascending in code-point order, as a fresh list. Every method call is answered in call order on one instance; void methods return nothing.",
